{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carolanne Marin, Princess of Prodo, is invited to Berlo, the capital of Birini and the great capital of Perfore, to see the Perforian in person with a request.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a maze adventure game with cinematic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the game on three different difficulties, whether in story mode, adventure mode, or challenge mode. Therefore, if you want to discover all the secrets hidden within, challenge mode is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfore is a game set in a medieval world where each continent is an island, each island is a country, each country is a kingdom, and each village is a city with a lord. The world is a kingdom, each island is a state, and each state has a king, and everyone wants to become the supreme king (Perforian). The story takes place in 2010, where technology has remained similar to that of the medieval era, with semi-advanced technology due to magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is an introduction to the series.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900360?t=1768405141","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900360/850800ff1912f26d3d39815c89b5bdb02642492a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768405141","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900360/61f8d0fa01d96b6417c38c9da723139bf1bc10af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768405141","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900360/61f8d0fa01d96b6417c38c9da723139bf1bc10af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768405141","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3900580,"desc